{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57213","headline":"谶 二 · 菩提达摩","name":"谶 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"心中虽吉外头凶，（心中者，周字也。\n外头凶者，周王无道灭佛法也）川下僧房名不中。\n（川下僧房者，俗号僧房爲邑，川下邑爲邕字也。\n後周文帝〖陈按：应作武帝〗姓字文，名泰邕。\n不中者，後周沙汰灭佛法。\n）爲遇毒龙生武子，（毒龙者，武帝父王也。\n生武子者，生武帝也）忽逢小鼠寂无穷。\n（小鼠者，庚子也。\n周武帝庚子崩。\n寂无穷者，尽灭无也）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"菩提达摩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57213.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57213","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}